        "205",
        "89"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:136145ccc0542363c0492cca",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我会用属于我自己的方式去奔驰……\\n为了证明这份决心──我绝对会赢喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5177f467e0406c38577d801f6b3bbfebe414898910691d6bd757f9348259e4b0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "205",
        "890"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72f83dbc7323585de90bdb60",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "漂亮地攻上果岭。接着要一杆进洞。\\n然后就只差挥杆拿下胜利，大概是这样吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f380fbb77290355a4d1698c6acaa323dd72c6fb23cd3164775cf1937ebaa7c34",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
